{"3589910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voivod: The Nuclear Warrior", "steam_appid": 3589910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal post-apocalyptic world adapted from the visionary universe of the metal band Voivod. In this action-adventure Metroidvania, you’ll battle biomechanical horrors, explore shifting landscapes, and piece together a reality that’s rapidly falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/8ebd70540853264c09ac47c22a17afa3.poster.avif?t=1788269619\" width=624 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/8ebd70540853264c09ac47c22a17afa3.webm?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/8ebd70540853264c09ac47c22a17afa3.mp4?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Voivod, a warrior lost in a nightmarish wasteland of nuclear devastation, mechanical horrors, and shifting dimensions. Your body is constantly mutating, and in the process, you have lost your mind. Now, guided by your disembodied consciousness, <i>Nothingface</i>, you must recover fragments of your memory scattered across this surreal world. Only when all pieces are found can you hope to escape this cosmic horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/adfcaba406ad6f916bfe122b1f9a7d6b.avif?t=1788269619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore war-torn landscapes, infiltrate cybernetic fortresses, and battle against twisted creatures drawn from Voivod’s intricate mythology. Each environment and enemy is crafted to reflect the band’s unique sci-fi aesthetic, immersing players in a journey that is both chaotic and exhilarating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/171698ec97b606eb5642b7deb4af2c5b.poster.avif?t=1788269619\" width=624 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/171698ec97b606eb5642b7deb4af2c5b.webm?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/171698ec97b606eb5642b7deb4af2c5b.mp4?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Run-and-Gun Combat</strong> – Shoot, slash, and blast your way through hordes of cybernetic abominations and intergalactic warlords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania-Style Exploration</strong> – Unlock new weapons and abilities to navigate a fractured reality and uncover hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable Boss Battles</strong> – Confront massive creatures, twisted experiments, and bizarre entities lurking throughout a dystopian Voivodian world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Retro Pixel-Art Aesthetic</strong> – Gritty and atmospheric, evoking the classic era of 90s action-platformers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Voivodian Soundtrack</strong> – Features reworked tracks from Voivod’s current lineup, carefully adapted to fit a vintage video game aesthetic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/c37b791b017ceb7a5afdfa5422102dcc.avif?t=1788269619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Band’s Involvement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is more than just an adaptation—it’s a full collaboration with Voivod. The band is actively involved in ensuring that the world, music, and artistic vision stay true to their universe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Michel Langevin (Away)</strong> contributes to the game’s visual design and artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daniel Mongrain (Chewy)</strong> supervises the adaptation of Voivod’s music into a retro-game format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Denis Bélanger (Snake)</strong> provides the voice of the protagonist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominic Laroche (Rocky)</strong> playtests and provides gameplay feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/7bc02034c85e89a9322403e3811d591d.poster.avif?t=1788269619\" width=624 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/7bc02034c85e89a9322403e3811d591d.webm?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/7bc02034c85e89a9322403e3811d591d.mp4?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help bring <i>Voivod: The Nuclear Warrior</i> to life by wishlisting it today! Your support boosts the game’s visibility and ensures that this vision of metal and mayhem reaches its full potential. Stay tuned for updates, exclusive content, and more as the project evolves!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal post-apocalyptic world adapted from the visionary universe of the metal band Voivod. In this action-adventure Metroidvania, you’ll battle biomechanical horrors, explore shifting landscapes, and piece together a reality that’s rapidly falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/8ebd70540853264c09ac47c22a17afa3.poster.avif?t=1788269619\" width=624 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/8ebd70540853264c09ac47c22a17afa3.webm?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/8ebd70540853264c09ac47c22a17afa3.mp4?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Voivod, a warrior lost in a nightmarish wasteland of nuclear devastation, mechanical horrors, and shifting dimensions. Your body is constantly mutating, and in the process, you have lost your mind. Now, guided by your disembodied consciousness, <i>Nothingface</i>, you must recover fragments of your memory scattered across this surreal world. Only when all pieces are found can you hope to escape this cosmic horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/adfcaba406ad6f916bfe122b1f9a7d6b.avif?t=1788269619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p 