tic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/c37b791b017ceb7a5afdfa5422102dcc.avif?t=1788269619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Band’s Involvement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is more than just an adaptation—it’s a full collaboration with Voivod. The band is actively involved in ensuring that the world, music, and artistic vision stay true to their universe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Michel Langevin (Away)</strong> contributes to the game’s visual design and artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daniel Mongrain (Chewy)</strong> supervises the adaptation of Voivod’s music into a retro-game format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Denis Bélanger (Snake)</strong> provides the voice of the protagonist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominic Laroche (Rocky)</strong> playtests and provides gameplay feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/7bc02034c85e89a9322403e3811d591d.poster.avif?t=1788269619\" width=624 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/7bc02034c85e89a9322403e3811d591d.webm?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589910/extras/7bc02034c85e89a9322403e3811d591d.mp4?t=1788269619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help bring <i>Voivod: The Nuclear Warrior</i> to life by wishlisting it today! Your support boosts 